# OZONE world – Sektor_01_SilentPines (Terran Prime / Mission 1)
# NyLeve-style forested gorge: cliff-top arrival, stepped descent, river and
# bridge, waterfall into a plunge pool, Nali-style shrine ruins, pine valley.
# Format: ozone v1.0
# Hierarchy: Terran Prime -> Sefirah 1 -> Sektor_01_SilentPines
#
# The playable route is unchanged, but the falls now hide a second, optional
# branch: a machine scar cut into the cliff behind the water. It exists to make
# the three Phase-7 mechanics readable in content:
#   * the choir  – a reverse-gravity shaft (ZONE_GRAVITY + 3-axis up)
#   * the wound  – a CRT control room (ZONE_CRT)
#   * the vault  – quantum brushes that phase out when looked at (SURF_QUANTUM)
# The branch pays a shotgun and supplies, so it is worth the detour but never
# gates the shrine exit. It also doubles the world's authored footprint, which
# is the point: the sky zone and lighting below cover the larger map, and the
# renderer no longer culls a whole landmark just because the camera left its
# gameplay zone.
#
# All-brush terrain on purpose: collision is AABB-only, so cliffs and terraces
# are brushes (a heightmap would give walk-through cliff faces). Every walkable
# rise is 0.9 or less - kStepHeight is exactly 1.0 and a rise of 1.0 sits on the
# float boundary.
#
# Box arg order is  x y z  w h d  rot  where h is the VERTICAL size (Z) and d is
# the Y depth. OZONE is Z-up: authored z = height.
#
# UV NOTE: BuildBox multiplies the generated UVs by 16 (h >= 1.0) or 8 (thin),
# so an authored texScale is a MULTIPLIER on top of that. Values near 1 are
# correct here; the 8-14 range compounds into moire noise.
#
# Zone names are the lookup keys for the sibling .ozls defs in this directory;
# renaming one without re-keying its def silently drops fog/ambient at load.
# The scar's interior sky zone is a nested pocket inside the outer world sky.
# UpdateSkyZone picks the SMALLEST containing volume, so the interior wins while
# the player is inside and the outer sky resumes at the tunnel mouth.

# --- Arrival plateau (playerstart #1 sits at its edge, facing down the gorge) ---
add box -91 0 8 42 20 140 0 texPath=GameData/Worlds/EngineTest/oztex/tileset/05_grass_jungle_256.png texScaleU=0.8 texScaleV=0.8

